    "text": "Larspell.\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, Sanctus Gregorius cw\u00e6\u00f0: ic eow halsige on \u00f0one drihten, \u00fee gescop heofenas and\nAnd utan mid inweardre heortan \u00feencan ymbe \u00fea godcundan lare, \u00fee us godcunde lareowas l\u00e6ra\u00f0 and\nCyrice is \u00fe\u00e6re sawle scip and sceld on domes d\u00e6g, and heo is us gesceapen to gebedhuse, na to nanum\n\u00d0onne is hit gecweden on halgum bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc man h\u00e6f\u00f0 twegen lareowas on d\u00e6g and twegen on\n\u00d0onne to sunnan upgange \u00feonne bringa\u00f0 hy gode on gewrite, se engel eall, \u00fe\u00e6t we on \u00f0\u00e6re nihte to\nAnd hy cuma\u00f0 to sunnan setlgange and bringa\u00f0 gode eall, \u00fe\u00e6t we to gode gedo\u00f0 and eac to yfele.\nAnd swa hy us eac l\u00e6da\u00f0 into cyrican, \u00feonne l\u00e6r\u00f0 us godes engel stilnesse and gemetlice spr\u00e6ce and\n\u00deonne l\u00e6r\u00f0 us se deofol unstilnesse and ungemetlice hleahtras and unnytte spr\u00e6ce and unnytte\n\u00d0onne se \u00f0e o\u00f0erne t\u00e6lan wille, \u00feonne gange he \u00e6rest on digle stowe and besceawige hine sylfne and\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00feeah n\u00e6fre nan man leahterleas ne synleas ealra \u00feinga.\nWa \u00f0\u00e6s mannes sawle, \u00fee \u00f0a unnyttan spr\u00e6ca sprec\u00f0 and \u00fea ungemetlican hleahtras drif\u00f0 innan cyrcan,\n\u00d0a \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t do\u00f0, hi beo\u00f0 asceadene fram \u00fe\u00e6re heofonlican cyrican and eallum hyre gemanan to deofla\nNytan hy na, hu heard wite hy \u00f0\u00e6s to leanes habban sceolan \u00e6fter domes d\u00e6ge, butan hy hit gebetan \u00e6r\nAnd us beoda\u00f0 ure godcundan lareowas \u00feurh witegena word, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge gehadodum mannum ge\n\u00d0onne l\u00e6ra\u00f0 hy us eac swa oft, swa we oftost magon, \u00fe\u00e6t we secan ure cyrican mid \u00e6lmessum and mid\nAnd \u00feancien we \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan drihtne ealre \u00fe\u00e6re are, \u00fee he us on twelf mon\u00f0um to forl\u00e6tt.\nNe rec\u00f0 god \u00e6lmihtig \u00fe\u00e6re forgolpenan \u00e6lmessan ne \u00f0\u00e6s gymeleasan gebedes.\n\u00d0\u00e6t hine l\u00e6r\u00f0 se deofol, \u00fe\u00e6t he stande and gorette and locige underb\u00e6c ut.\n\u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 gymeleas gebed, and he hit ne m\u00e6g gebetan, for\u00f0an \u00fee se deofol h\u00e6f\u00f0 his heortan on his handa,\nAc he sceal eallum mode and eallum m\u00e6gne to gode \u00feencan ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t heofoncunde rice and bigean his\nWa \u00fe\u00e6s mannes sawle, \u00fee nyle geswican unnytre spr\u00e6ce and unnyttes ge\u00feances; he bi\u00f0 wyrsa \u00feonne\nFor\u00f0am he amyr\u00f0 \u00e6g\u00f0er ge hine sylfne ge m\u00e6nige o\u00f0re men, for\u00f0am \u00e6lce man hata\u00f0 \u00feone hund and\nSanctus Paulus apostolus w\u00e6s sprecende and s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t him godes engel \u00e6teowde sume arlease sawle\nAnd he geseah, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron micel meniu engla and deofla; and \u00fea fuhton swi\u00f0e \u00feearle \u00fea englas and\nAnd \u00fea w\u00e6ron \u00fea englas swy\u00f0e sarige on heora mode.\nAnd \u00fea deoflu hy potedon and \u00feoddetton \u00fea earman sawle and heton hy ut faran ra\u00f0e of \u00feam lichaman\n\u00d0a axode Sanctus Paulus \u00feone engel swy\u00f0e forhtigendre st\u00e6mne and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: min hlaford, hw\u00e6t\n\u00d0a s\u00e6de he him, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re cyrican slitere, and \u00feonne he \u00fe\u00e6rin com, \u00feonne hyscte he on \u00f0a\nAnd \u00feonne se goda heap ongan singan and god herian and r\u00e6ddan godspell and s\u00e6don ymbe Cristes\nAnd him \u00f0uhte \u00feonne seo tid to lang, \u00fe\u00e6t he hit gehyrde and \u00fe\u00e6rinne w\u00e6re, and wende hine \u00feonne\nAnd se deofol hine l\u00e6rde \u00feonne eall \u00fe\u00e6t and l\u00e6dde hine \u00feonne ut of \u00fe\u00e6re cyrican be \u00f0am locce.\nSwa oft, swa he \u00fe\u00e6rinne w\u00e6s, him \u00feuhte \u00e6fre to lang, hwonne he moste beon ymbe \u00fe\u00e6s lichaman\nAnd he sceal standan on \u00fe\u00e6re fyrenan ea o\u00f0 his weleras o\u00f0 domes d\u00e6g, \u00f0\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 nan gefea ne nan\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se engel eft to Paule: folga me, \u00feonne \u00e6teowe ic \u00f0e sumes so\u00f0f\u00e6stes mannes sawle ut\n\u00d0a eodon hy.\n\u00dea ymbe lytel \u00fea clypode se engel to Paule and cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to: loca hider.\n\u00dea locade he \u00feider; \u00f0a geseah he \u00fea halgan sawle ut of \u00feam godan lichaman gangende, and he geseah\nAnd \u00fea englas hy genamon \u00e6t \u00feam deoflum and oferst\u00e6ldon hy mid hire godum d\u00e6dum.\nAnd \u00fea deoflu wendon sceamigende aweg, and hy w\u00e6ron on miclum uns\u00e6lum.\nAnd \u00fea englas w\u00e6ron on swi\u00f0e micelre blisse, and hy heton byrigean \u00feone godan lichaman and \u00feus\nAnd se goda lichama w\u00e6s \u00fea get sprecende and \u00feancode gode ealre \u00fe\u00e6re are and \u00fe\u00e6re blisse and \u00fe\u00e6re\nAnd he s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t him n\u00e6re n\u00e6fre \u00e6r swa e\u00f0e ne swa myrige on nanum yfele, swa him \u00fea w\u00e6s, and he\nAnd him andswaredon \u00fea englas and s\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t him w\u00e6re hundteontigfealdlice mare myrh\u00f0 and blis\n\u00d0a axode Paulus \u00feone engel, hw\u00e6t seo gode sawel w\u00e6re.\n\u00d0a s\u00e6de he him, \u00fe\u00e6t heo w\u00e6re mildheortnesse fyligende and sta\u00f0olf\u00e6st on hire heortan wi\u00f0 deofles\nAnd heo lufode \u00fea halgan cyrican and gastlice gebedu and f\u00e6sten and \u00e6lmessan and \u00fea godcundan\nAnd eal cristen folc heo lufode swa hire f\u00e6der o\u00f0\u00f0e moder and s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t hy w\u00e6ron hire geswustra.\nAnd \u00feonne se heap ongan singan godes lofsangas and r\u00e6ddon godspel, \u00feonne bletsode heo hy, and\nAnd se \u00f0e w\u00e6s cyrican ehtere and nolde gehyran ne gelyfan on \u00fea godcundan lare, \u00feonne onscunode\nAnd heo nolde n\u00e6fre cuman to godes weofode butan hire \u00e6lmessan, for\u00f0am nan man nah to godes\nFor\u00f0an hit is ger\u00e6d and gecweden on halgum bocum, \u00f0\u00e6t, swa swa w\u00e6ter adw\u00e6sce\u00f0 fyr, swa\nAnd sceal beon seo gode sawel on Abrahames f\u00e6\u00f0mum o\u00f0 domes d\u00e6g.\nBe \u00f0am we magon niman bysne be woruld\u00feingum; se man, \u00fee bring\u00f0 medsceat \u00feam gerefan, se\nWe eow s\u00e6cga\u00f0 to so\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t, se \u00f0e nele her his synna nu andettan his scrifte and betan, swa he him\nSwa him bi\u00f0 on domes d\u00e6g, butan he his synna \u00e6r bewreo mid andetnesse and mid d\u00e6dbote and mid\n\u00d0a so\u00f0f\u00e6stan men \u00feonne geseo\u00f0 heora wuldor and heora wlite and blisse hym toweard, and \u00fea\nWe magon a\u00f0wean mid \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum ure synna of urum lichaman.\nAnd we eow bidda\u00f0, for eowres drihtnes lufan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge d\u00e6ghwamlice d\u00e6lan \u00e6lmessan be \u00f0am d\u00e6le, \u00fee\nWa \u00f0\u00e6s mannes sawle, \u00fee betyn\u00f0 his duru ongean godes \u00feearfan for \u00f0am \u00feingon, \u00fe\u00e6t hine l\u00e6r\u00f0 se\nAc beon we \u00e6fre cumli\u00f0e; ure sawel bi\u00f0 Cristes cuma on \u00feam forhtigendan domes d\u00e6ge.\nUtan lufian ure cyrican, for\u00f0am heo bi\u00f0 ure fri\u00f0iend and werigend wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t micele fyr on domes d\u00e6g.\nAnd wyrcan we simle brycge and \u00fea betan.\n\u00d0eah se man nime \u00e6nne stan and lecge on ful sloh, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmesman m\u00e6ge mid \u00feam o\u00f0rum fet\nEac be\u00f0earf seo sawel on domes d\u00e6g rihtes weges and cl\u00e6nes and sta\u00f0olf\u00e6stre brycge ofer \u00feone\nB\u00e6rnon we urne lichaman mid cl\u00e6num gebedum \u00e6t urum heortan and mid f\u00e6stenum and mid\nAnd toforan eallum o\u00f0rum \u00feingum wite gehwa, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6bbe cl\u00e6ne heortan to eallum cristenum\n\u00d0onne ne beo nan man o\u00f0res mannes \u00e6lmessan to geornfull, butan he wite, \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ge \u00e6g\u00f0er\n\u00d0onne ge\u00fe\u00e6nce \u00e6lc man himself, hu swi\u00f0e man pinsa\u00f0 \u00fea sawle on domes d\u00e6g, \u00feonne man sett \u00fea\nAnd gif \u00fea penegas teo\u00f0 swi\u00f0or \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t gold, \u00feonne miswyr\u00f0 \u00feam men hra\u00f0e.\nSwa bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re sawle and \u00fe\u00e6re synne; gif seo synn tih\u00f0 swy\u00f0or, \u00feonne seo sawel, \u00feonne fara\u00f0 hy butu\nAnd \u00fea synna yrna\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re earman sawle and hire \u00feus to cwe\u00f0a\u00f0: hwi noldest \u00f0u, earme, betan\nHwy noldest \u00f0u, forwyrhte, biddan \u00fee arfulle \u00feingeras wi\u00f0 \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan \u00ferym \u00fe\u00e6re halgan\nHwi noldest \u00f0u, unges\u00e6lige, andettan \u00feinum drihtne and biddan \u00feone halgan Michael, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re \u00fee\nAnd \u00feonne get \u00feus greta\u00f0 grimmum st\u00e6fnum: hw\u00e6t sceoldon \u00fee, \u00feeodeor\u00f0an fylnes, ure \u00e6lmessan?\n\u00d0u us gehete godcunde gebedo and cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6sten and gastlice w\u00e6ccan, and \u00feu hit us aluge; and \u00feu\nAnd we gelyfdon on \u00f0e swa on urne drihten, and \u00feu h\u00e6fst us ealle beswicen and bel\u00e6wed.\nWe wendon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu w\u00e6re godfyrht and h\u00e6fdest gastlice geb\u00e6ru beforan us, ac \u00f0u h\u00e6fdest deofles\nAc heo \u00fee sceal beon nu swy\u00f0e grimme forgolden, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu w\u00e6re swa unge\u00feancfull \u00feinum drihtne, ne\nAnd \u00feu w\u00e6re swa gifre swa hund, and \u00feu n\u00e6fre n\u00e6re full \u00fee ma, \u00fee hell.\nSceamige \u00fee nu \u00feinra un\u00f0eawa betwux dea\u00f0e and deoflum.\nAnd \u00feu w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6r mor\u00f0 and myr\u00f0ra, ac \u00feu ne miht her swa beon.\nAc \u00feu his scealt nu her wite habban on \u00fe\u00e6re grimman helle mid deoflum and mid dracum and mid\nGe\u00feence gehwa himsylf, hu sceort and hu earmlic \u00feis l\u00e6ne lif is.\nNe yldan we na fram d\u00e6ge to d\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6t we to gode ne gecyrron, for\u00f0am \u00fee we us nytan witod lif o\u00f0\nNe us ne \u00feearf na tweonian, \u00fe\u00e6t we o\u00f0rum ne scylon gebyrian butan tweon, o\u00f0\u00f0e heofonwarena\nHit is earmlic and sorhlic eallum cristenum mannum to gehyranne and to geseonne eall, \u00fe\u00e6t man us\nAnd se man bi\u00f0 swa blind and swa deaf, and he bi\u00f0 swa heard swa stan, and he ne m\u00e6g ongitan \u00fea\n\u00c6ghwylcum men is to onscunianne \u00e6lc oferfyll on \u00e6lcum timan, for\u00f0am \u00fee heo is drihtne swy\u00f0e la\u00f0.\nOferfyll bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re sawle feond and \u00fe\u00e6s lichaman unh\u00e6l.\nSe \u00f0e his to fela nym\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 wodum men gelic; and hit bi\u00f0 m\u00e6gbana and mor\u00f0slaga, and hit ne\nEalle unsibba hit wyrc\u00f0, and hit aluc\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mannes mod \u00feurh deofles costnunge.\n\u00d0onne secga\u00f0 us ure godcundan lareowas, \u00fe\u00e6t hy nyton \u00fea tid, hw\u00e6nne we of \u00feysum earman life\nSwa bi\u00f0 \u00feam godcundum mannum, \u00fee us la\u00f0ia\u00f0 to heofona rices wuldre, \u00fe\u00e6t hy nyton \u00fea tid, \u00fee se\nGod us to \u00f0am gefultumige, amen.",
